### Teste de Sincronização de Databases - Versão Corrigida

### 1. Verificar status de sincronização
GET http://localhost:8000/api/Sync/sync-status
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Forçar sincronização das databases via gRPC
POST http://localhost:8000/api/Sync/force-sync-databases
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Sincronizar databases via gRPC (método preferido)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/Sync/sync-databases-grpc
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Verificar status das databases locais
GET http://localhost:8000/api/Sync/database-status
Content-Type: application/json

### 5. Verificar status do streaming gRPC
GET http://localhost:8000/api/Sync/streaming-status
Content-Type: application/json

### 6. Verificar saúde da conexão
GET http://localhost:8000/api/Sync/connection-health
Content-Type: application/json

### 7. Registrar nó e iniciar streaming (teste completo)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/Sync/register-node
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodeId": "test-node-123",
  "name": "Test Node",
  "machineName": "DESKTOP-78ROEFC",
  "machineId": "58bc0c2d-5fd8-4d25-80ec-f41cef3cb615",
  "ipAddress": "::1",
  "port": 5000,
  "databasePath": null,
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "operatingSystem": "Windows"
}

### 8. Atualizar tamanhos das databases
POST http://localhost:8000/api/Sync/update-database-sizes
Content-Type: application/json